From: SaaiOS <os@saaios>
Subject: synaptics td4150: since32 drain until idle, stock 0x42 after 0x45

since31 clocked all 97k (one 0x45, remaining=0) then drained a leftover
0x1b, but ATTN re-asserted. RUN_APPLICATION 0x14 on gpio=0 timed out -62.
RUN_APPLICATION is not stock after ROMBOOT DOWNLOAD.

Stock zeroflash_do_romboot_firmware_download after write_message==0:
  switch_mode(FW_MODE_BOOTLOADER)
which from RomBoot is CMD_ROMBOOT_RUN_BOOTLOADER_FIRMWARE 0x42, not
IDENTIFY/GET_BOOT_INFO/RESET/RUN_APPLICATION. reserved prefix is stock
([0]=size>>16, [1..13]=0). Blob is ROMBOOT_APP_CODE (97280), not the
whole 147456 file. Checksum is the area CRC32, not reserved[1..13].

since32:
- After remaining=0: drain until gpio=1 or 8 frames. Log each once:
  code= plen= payload= mode= gpio=. Log 0x1b firmware_status bits.
- If gpio never idles: disable_irq, one force read, then the stock
  command. Never send a TCM command while gpio=0 except that fallback.
- Stock post-download: switch_mode BOOTLOADER (0x42). Identify only
  if ATTN is idle. Never retry 97k. Never touch_init in 0x04.
- Keep: no ENABLE_REPORT 0x05, no do_polling, no IRQ printk flood.

Applies after syna-tcm-romboot-after-send-drain.patch.

